Package: ImmunoCompass
Title: Immune Balance Index and Immune-Context Gene Effect Decomposition
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R:
    person(given = "ImmunoCompass", family = "Authors",
           role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "lydiaMyr@users.noreply.github.com")
Author: ImmunoCompass Authors
Maintainer: ImmunoCompass Authors <lydiaMyr@users.noreply.github.com>
Description: Calculates the transcriptome-based Immune Balance Index (IBI)
    from the locked 390 gene-pair panel and decomposes gene-level expression
    effects into background-associated (BAS), condition-associated (CAS), and
    interaction-associated (IAS) components.
